// ============================================================================
// tv8k_soc_ral_pkg -- UVM register model of the APB slots, generated by
// socgen from socgen/specs/tv8k_soc.yaml. Open-ip blocks come from docs/ip/<IP>.md of
// open-ip-portfolio @ 359f40a67051; the others from register_blocks.
//   tv8k_soc_reg_block   top block, map "map" at 0 (AXI byte addresses)
//   <slot>_blk          one sub-block per mapped APB slot
//   tv8k_soc_axi_reg_adapter  RAL <-> axi4_item, single 32-bit beats
// Registers whose value the hardware changes (core-backed, pop, W1C) are
// marked NO_REG_TESTS; the reset test checks the rest.
// ============================================================================
